ith an orchestrator error, leaving the service on mixed versions. I retried, and the second attempt completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the timeline, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks before it is released again, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt.", "type": "text"}]}]}